## Scope
We scan dashboard state on disk, the static HTML snapshots, plan
evidence/docs, design intake docs, the upstream Claude Design v3 pack,
and the dashboard README for credential value-shapes. Those are the
artifacts that could be served, copied into review, or handed to an
agent. We also report the count of value-word mentions (prose like
'webhook secret cannot be provisioned by DontPanic') so the operator
can sanity-check the absence.

## Regex (value shapes — anything matching here would be a real leak)
(sk-[A-Za-z0-9]{20,}|AIza[0-9A-Za-z_-]{20,}|ghp_[A-Za-z0-9]{20,}|gho_[A-Za-z0-9]{20,}|xox[abp]-[A-Za-z0-9-]{12,}|AKIA[0-9A-Z]{16}|-----BEGIN[ A-Z]+PRIVATE KEY-----|eyJ[A-Za-z0-9._-]{30,}|bearer[[:space:]]+[A-Za-z0-9._-]{20,}|(api[_-]?key|access[_-]?token|refresh[_-]?token|password|client[_-]?secret)[[:space:]]*[:=][[:space:]]*["']?[A-Za-z0-9._/+-]{12,})

## Regex (word mentions — prose hits are allowed and expected)
(api[_-]?key|secret|password|passwd|private[_-]?key|access[_-]?token|refresh[_-]?token)

